title: Banned
subtitle: A party paper is closed by order.
new-page: true
tags: event
priority: -1
view-if: {!
if (typeof RG === 'undefined') { return false; }
if (!RG.lw && this.game.scenes.lw_lib) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.lw_lib.onArrival); }
return !!(RG.lw && RG.lw.ready('paper_banned'));
!}
on-arrival: {!
if (!RG.lw) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.lw_lib.onArrival); }
RG.lw.fire('paper_banned');
Q.lw_n = RG.lw.rnd(2, 6);
Q.lw_paper_cap = Q.lw_paper.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + Q.lw_paper.slice(1);
RG.news(Q.lw_paper_cap + ' banned for ' + Q.lw_n + ' weeks', 2);
!}

= Banned

A police officer with a typed order came to the printing works this morning: **[+ lw_paper_cap +]** is banned for [+ lw_n +] weeks, under the emergency decree, for an article "endangering public order". The article was about the police in [+ lw_d_name +].

The formes are sealed and the bundles of today's edition are on a lorry to the police headquarters. The printers are standing in the yard, smoking, waiting for someone to tell them whether they will be paid this week.

A party without its paper is a party that cannot speak to its members, and in [+ lw_d_name +] the paper is the party.

- @rename: Bring it out tomorrow under another name.
- @underground: Print it in secret and hand it out at the gates.
- @court: Fight the ban in the courts.
- @printers: Call out the printers of the city.

@rename
subtitle: The old trick: a new title, the same paper. Readers love it; the police will try again.
on-arrival: {!
Q.worker_support += 1;
RG.district(Q.lw_d, {loyalty: 3, repression: 3});
RG.news('Banned communist paper reappears under a new name in ' + Q.lw_town);
RG.lw.lean('luxemburgist', 1, 3);
!}

The next morning a new paper appears on the streets of [+ lw_town +], with a new name, the same editor, the same typeface and, on the front page, the article that got the old one banned.

@underground
subtitle: An illegal paper costs members and carries risk. It cannot be banned. The Left's preference.
on-arrival: {!
RG.district(Q.lw_d, {members: -0.03, loyalty: 6, militancy: 3});
Q.red_guards_loyalty += 2;
RG.lw.lean('offensive', 1, 4);
!}

A hand press goes into a cellar under a laundry. The paper comes out on two sheets, smudged, twice a week, and is handed out at the works gates by young comrades who run when they see a helmet.

@court
subtitle: Costs 1 fund. The ban may be lifted, and the decree tested. The Right's way.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We have no funds.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
if (Math.random() < 0.55) {
    Q.lw_out = 1;
    RG.district(Q.lw_d, {repression: -6});
    RG.news('Court lifts the ban on ' + Q.lw_paper);
} else {
    Q.lw_out = 2;
}
RG.lw.lean('unionist', 1, 3);
!}

[? if lw_out = 1 : The administrative court finds that the article criticised the police but did not endanger anyone. The paper is back after nine days. ?][? if lw_out = 2 : The court upholds the ban, and adds the costs. The paper is back when the ban runs out, and not before. ?]

@printers
subtitle: If the printers stop, no paper in the city appears, not even the bourgeois ones.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lw_d_mil >= 55 || Math.random() < 0.3) {
    Q.lw_out = 1;
    RG.district(Q.lw_d, {repression: -5, militancy: 4});
    Q.worker_support += 2;
} else {
    Q.lw_out = 2;
    RG.district(Q.lw_d, {repression: 4});
    Q.worker_support -= 1;
}
RG.lw.lean('offensive', 1, 2);
RG.lw.lean('luxemburgist', 1, 1);
!}

[? if lw_out = 1 : The compositors of [+ lw_town +] stop work at noon. The next morning, no newspaper at all appears in the city, and on the third day the ban is quietly withdrawn. ?][? if lw_out = 2 : The printers' union says it does not strike for party papers. Our own compositors come out alone, and are replaced. ?]
